cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use or reference this guide, please cite it as below.
title: Agent Memory Design Guide
abstract: >-
  A vendor-neutral design guide for structuring persistent memory in AI
  agents, covering namespacing, atomic writes, write-time gating,
  deletion and supersession, and the trust boundary between retrieved
  memory and agent instructions.
